  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, add the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Rinse and drain white rice.\n• Add rice. Stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low. Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat. Keep covered, until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• While the rice is cooking, cut haloumi into bite-sized chunks. Transfer haloumi to a medium bowl, then add enough water to cover. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don’t peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cda5aa0d670a6c9690a7f-f74fe98c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the rice is cooking, cut haloumi into bite-sized chunks. Transfer haloumi to a medium bowl, then add enough water to cover.\n• Roughly chop brown onion. Thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Finely chop garlic. Drain haloumi, then pat dry.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. When oil is hot, cook haloumi, tossing occasionally, in batches, until golden brown, 2-4 minutes. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cda5aa0d670a6c9690a7f-74a43108.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook onion and carrot, tossing, until golden, 4-5 minutes. Add garlic, tomato paste, Mumbai spice blend, mild North Indian spice blend (see ingredients) and the honey and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Reduce heat to medium, then stir in thickened cream and the water (for the sauce). Return haloumi to the pan. Simmer until thickened, 2-3 minutes. Remove pan from heat, then stir in the butter, a pinch of pepper and baby spinach leaves, until spinach is just wilted, 1 minute. ~~~~~~~~~~ MODULAR STEP ~~~~~~~~~~",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cda5aa0d670a6c9690a7f-c930ea18.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide basmati rice between bowls. Top with haloumi masala.\n• Garnish with flaked almonds. Tear over coriander leaves to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cda5aa0d670a6c9690a7f-64e90667.jpeg"
    }
  ]
